<?[self]((topic)) = 'intro'?>
You see a girl leaning against the wall near the Harbor Port entrance.
She is puffing on a lit up hookah that is strapped to her waist.

She appears to be in her mid twenties.

She has a sharply angled bob hair cut and there are Kanji characters etched
into her face and they glow with a flickering light.

She is wearing a black baby doll dress that has subtly shimmering seams.
